{title: Cast the Net on the Right Side}
{subtitle: John 21:3–12}
{key: C}
{tempo: 102}
{time: 2/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [–] | [C] | [C] | [F] |
| [C] | [C] | [C] | [C] |
